{
  "schema": 1,
  "description": "Narrow official-source frontier for the first strict Minecraft 26.2 Configuration route and its source-inseparable fresh-player handoff. It intentionally excludes optional server-links, code-of-conduct, resource-pack, cookie and unrelated Play/gameplay branches. Packet IDs remain derived only after reviewed VAR admission.",
